":"ISBN:9781559392327","info_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL15593871M/Transforming_adversity_into_joy_and_courage","preview":"noview","preview_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL15593871M/Transforming_adversity_into_joy_and_courage","details":{"publishers":["Snow Lion Publications"],"number_of_pages":312,"subtitle":"an explanation of The thirty-seven practices of Bodhisattvas","description":{"type":"/type/text","value":"\"A practical and inspiring guide for developing our ability to be happy and benefit others, this commentary on The Thirty-seven Practices of Bodhisattvas by Gyalsay Togme Sangpo is studied by followers of all schools of Tibetan Buddhism. The root text gives, in thirty-seven short verses, the essential practices leading to enlightenment. Gyalsay Togme Sangpo (1295-1369) was renowned as a bodhisattva in Tibet and revered for living according to the bodhisattva ideals and practices that he taught. He inspired not only his direct disciples but also generations of practitioners up to the present day.\" \"This commentary by Geshe Jampa Tegchok clearly explains the popular practice of exchanging oneself with others for developing love and compassion for all living beings. It lays open the methods for doing glance, stabilizing, and analytical meditations, and offers an in-depth discussion of the nature of emptiness. All the essentials are here for transforming our attitudes and developing courage and joy.\"--BOOK JACKET"},"isbn_10":["1559392320"],"lc_classifications":[""],"latest_revision":8,"key":"/books/OL15593871M","authors":[{"key":"/authors/OL4917302A","name":"Jampa Tegchok Geshe"}],"publish_places":["Ithaca, N.Y"],"contributions":["Thubten Chodron, 1950-","Rgyal-sras Thogs-med Bzaṅ-po-dpal, 1295-1369."],"isbn_13":["9781559392327"],"pagination":"312 p. :","source_records":["marc:marc_western_washington_univ/wwu_bibs.mrc_revrev.mrc:895382501:2383","bwb:9781559392327"],"title":"Transforming adversity into joy and courage","work_titles":["Transforming the heart"],"notes":{"type":"/type/text","value":"Previous ed. published in 1999 under the title: Transforming the heart.\n\nGift of Henry G. Schwarz.\n\nIncludes bibliographical references (p. [311]-312)."},"identifiers":{"librarything":["925664"],"goodreads":["571125"]},"created":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2008-09-20T16:47:31.525036"},"languages":[{"key":"/languages/eng"}],"subjects":["Rgyal-sras Thogs-med Bzaṅ-po-dpal, -- 1295-1369","Enlightenment (Buddhism) -- Requisites","Spiritual life -- Buddhism"],"publish_date":"2005","publish_country":"nyu","last_modified":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2020-10-08T18:46:20.546703"},"by_statement":"by Geshe Jampa Tegchok ; edited by Thubten Chodron.","oclc_numbers":["61709081"],"works":[{"key":"/works/OL11637313W"}],"type":{"key":"/type/edition"},"revision":8}}}